 - PAC write protection, DSU CRC32 and chip erase, SLEEPONEXIT and
-  STDBYCFG, and every other peripheral behaviour (PDEC, CAN, ...).
+  STDBYCFG, and every other peripheral behaviour (CAN, ...).
 
